            "review_title": "Review at Babel Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mumbaimum\nMumbai37 contributions\n0\nTerrible choice\nJan 2016 • Family\nWe were the only people eating here on a Friday night. We now know why. The pizza's were kids size for adult prices, the mango chicken salad was very small. One of the pizza's was cold. The bill was surprisingly high for the amount of food we got. The waiter tried his best but I advice him to look for a job at a better run restaurant.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 15, 2016\nBabel_Bistro\nDear @Mumbaimum,\n\nAt first, we would like to thank you for dining at Babel, and we are sorry to hear about your experience. Your feedback is valuable for us to improve our services. We sincerely hope to meet you at Babel again to see how much better we become now.\n\nHave a nice day!\nRead more\nWritten March 15, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
